 "html": "<a href=\"/the-lazy-aristocrat\"\n class=\"group rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-surface overflow-hidden flex gap-4 p-4 hover:border-violet-500/25 transition-all\"\n style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n <div class=\"shrink-0 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-white/5\"\n style=\"width:100px;aspect-ratio:2/3;flex-shrink:0;\">\n <img alt=\"The Lazy Aristocrat\"\n class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 blur-up\"\n src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\"\n data-thumb=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=cdn.meowing.org/uploads/RoIGEtuCQ8_&amp;w=20&amp;q=1\" data-src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=cdn.meowing.org/uploads/RoIGEtuCQ8_\">\n </div>\n <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white leading-tight line-clamp-2\">The Lazy Aristocrat </h2>\n <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\">\n <span\n class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[.6rem] font-medium uppercase text-white/70\">Fantasy</span>\n <span\n class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[.6rem] font-medium uppercase text-white/70\">Harem</span>\n <span\n class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[.6rem] font-medium uppercase text-white/70\">Reincarnation</span>\n </div>\n <div class=\"text-xs text-white/40 space-y-0.5\">\n <div><span class=\"text-white/25\">Author:</span> <span\n class=\"text-white/60\">Iko</span></div>\n <div><span class=\"text-white/25\">Type:</span> <span\n class=\"text-white/60\">MANGA</span></div>\n </div>\n <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">Luke is the languid second son of a villainous duke.\nBy some unexpected instance he comes to know of his own fate and in an attempt to avoid his own fate he works hard at finding a</p>\n </div>\n </a><a href=\"/when-i-the-lazy-villainous-noble-got-married-with-the-villainous-young-lady-who-had-her-engagement-broken-off-we-became-the-most-fearsome-couple\"\n class=\"group rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-surface overflow-hidden flex gap-4 p-4 hover:border-violet-500/25 transition-all\"\n style=\"box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n <div class=\"shrink-0 rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-white/5\"\n style=\"width:100px;aspect-ratio:2/3;flex-shrink:0;\">\n <img alt=\"When I, The Lazy Villainous Noble, Got Married With The Villainous Young Lady Who Had Her Engagement Broken Off, We Became The Most Fearsome Couple\"\n class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 blur-up\"\n src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\"\n data-thumb=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=cdn.meowing.org/uploads/b2I1XiHkId8&amp;w=20&amp;q=1\" data-src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=cdn.meowing.org/uploads/b2I1XiHkId8\">\n </div>\n <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-white leading-tight line-clamp-2\">When I, The Lazy Villainous Noble, Got Married With The Villainous Young Lady Who Had Her Engagement Broken Off, We Became The Most Fearsome Couple </h2>\n <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\">\n <span\n class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[.6rem] font-medium uppercase text-white/70\">Fantasy</span>\n <span\n class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[.6rem] font-medium uppercase text-white/70\">Action</span>\n <span\n class=\"rounded-full bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[.6rem] font-medium uppercase text-white/70\">Magic</span>\n </div>\n <div class=\"text-xs text-white/40 space-y-0.5\">\n <div><span class=\"text-white/25\">Author:</span> <span\n class=\"text-white/60\">Mesopo Tamia</span></div>\n <div><span class=\"text-white/25\">Type:</span> <span\n class=\"text-white/60\">MANGA</span></div>\n </div>\n <p class=\"text-xs text-white/40 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">When the Villainess Whose Engagement Was Broken Off Married This Lazy Noble Villain, We Became the Most Terrifying Couple\nAlban realized he had been reincarnated as the &quot;villaino</p>\n </div>\n </a>\n",
